WEBVTT

00:03:56.375 --> 00:04:01.559
will be defined by rival, distinct
and different ways of doing things,

00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:05.434
and ultimately collaboration
based on values,

00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:06.893
and this new world order

00:04:06.917 --> 00:04:09.309
is very much a work in progress.

00:04:09.333 --> 00:04:11.018
"Disorder" might be a better word,

00:04:11.042 --> 00:04:13.434
and it has been for some time.

00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:15.184
But think appropriately

00:04:15.208 --> 00:04:18.268
of great sheets of ice breaking apart,

00:04:18.292 --> 00:04:19.934
some drifting away

00:04:19.958 --> 00:04:22.893
and others later reforming.

00:04:22.917 --> 00:04:24.726
And the internet is a bit like this.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.601
It used to be global.

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:31.351
Google used to have 30 percent
of the market share in China,